<headroom-library version="1" id="clean-blackface-glass" category="Clean" order="10" instrument="guitar" style="Clean">
  <description>The classic American clean: a light studio compressor into a big blackface twin with the bright switch on and its own spring reverb, a hair of chorus for width. Glassy, wide and dynamic: dig in and it only gets louder, never dirty.</description>
  <tags><tag>Clean</tag><tag>Pop</tag><tag>Country</tag><tag>Funk &amp; Soul</tag><tag>Spring Reverb</tag><tag>Compressed</tag></tags>
  <sources>
